  "annotations": [
    { "id": "direction", "x": 1880, "y": 0, "w": 360, "text": "Poster direction\n\nBone-white paper, black ink, one electric cobalt, a vermilion stamp for sealing. Archivo at two widths (condensed heavy for statements, regular for reading), IBM Plex Mono for numbers. Print rules, index numbers, duotone photographs, square marks. No glow, no gradients, no glass.\n\nMotion: type slides in like a press, bars grow, the stamp thumps in askew, a cobalt ticker runs. The Landscape system is archived at design/archive/v4-landscape and its own link." },
    { "id": "photos", "x": 1880, "y": 964, "w": 360, "text": "Photographs are duotoned stand-ins for generated scenes (Unsplash licence: Tyler Criso, Kevin Bessat). In the product the scene is generated from the user's words, then posterised to cobalt." }
  ],
